  {
   "start": 0.34,
   "end": 239.23,
   "text": "Eyes up, eyes up. Got it boss. What'd you say? What? Is that for you? Good shit bro. But I could never get it down."
  },
  {
   "start": 266.6,
   "end": 385.36,
   "text": "You're fitting in this so nicely. Bro you are. This guy's waiting for the people with it. Green up. Touch the tracks. That's tough."
  },
  {
   "start": 388.44,
   "end": 393.97,
   "text": "My back wheel popped up. Diego can you hold my mic real quick? Photo time."
  },
  {
   "start": 401.39,
   "end": 405.53,
   "text": "The giant puddle from the lake, the little bone that we went through."
  },
  {
   "start": 407.43,
   "end": 408.31,
   "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
   "start": 408.61,
   "end": 412.51,
   "text": "Can you take a photo of them in exchange?"
  },
  {
   "start": 423.49,
   "end": 425.37,
   "text": "I almost did it in last week."
  },
  {
   "start": 425.69,
   "end": 426.51,
   "text": "Hey good stuff today."
  },
  {
   "start": 426.73,
   "end": 427.35,
   "text": "You're fast."
  },
  {
   "start": 429.41,
   "end": 429.91,
   "text": "Sure."
  },
  {
   "start": 439.39,
   "end": 479.29,
   "text": "Just means I got to play g2 All right, everyone pack in pack in smile. Oh Yes Professional Awesome. Thank you so much"
